  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Seabreeze Sanctuary – Spacious Coastal Retreat Near Inlet Beach<br>Welcome to Seabreeze Sanctuary, a beautifully maintained Emerald Coast retreat designed for relaxing coastal living. With bright open spaces, stylish furnishings, and multiple gathering areas, this inviting home is the perfect place for families and friends to reconnect and create lasting beach memories.<br>Thoughtfully designed with comfort in mind, the home features two spacious living rooms, an open dining area, and a well-equipped kitchen ideal for preparing meals after a day in the sun. The airy coastal décor and welcoming layout create a calm and relaxing atmosphere throughout the home.<br>Guests can also enjoy access to the beautiful community pool, perfect for cooling off after a beach day or relaxing poolside with family and friends.<br>Located in the heart of Inlet Beach, you are just a short walk to the Inlet Beach Public Beach Access, one of the area's most convenient beach entrances featuring parking, restrooms, showers, and lifeguards. The home is also within walking distance of Ave30A, where you'll find restaurants, coffee shops, boutiques, and entertainment, and just minutes from the charming communities of Rosemary Beach and Alys Beach.<br>Whether you're spending the day at the beach, exploring scenic bike trails, or enjoying sunset dinners along 30A, Seabreeze Sanctuary provides the perfect home base for your Emerald Coast getaway.<br>Beaches & Outdoor Adventures<br>Short walk to Inlet Beach Public Beach Access with restrooms, showers, and lifeguards<br>Easy access to Ave30A for dining, shopping, and local entertainment<br>Minutes from Rosemary Beach and Alys Beach<br>Relax at the beautiful community pool located within the neighborhood<br>Explore nearby Camp Helen State Park, Deer Lake State Park, and Grayton Beach State Park<br>Paddleboard or kayak on the rare coastal dune lakes<br>Bike along the scenic Timpoochee Trail that runs the length of Scenic Highway 30A<br>The Emerald Coast is famous for its sugar-white sand, emerald-green water, and spectacular sunsets, making Inlet Beach one of the most desirable destinations along 30A.<br>Sleeping Arrangements – Sleeps Up to 14<br>Designed for comfort and flexibility, the home offers plenty of space for large families or groups.<br>Primary Bedroom: King bed, private ensuite bathroom, Smart TV<br>Bedroom 2: Queen bed<br>Bedroom 3: Twin-over-Full bunk bed<br>Bedroom 4: Twin-over-Full bunk bed<br>Living Room 1: Sleeper sofa<br>Living Room 2: Sleeper sofa<br>With two living areas and spacious bedrooms, everyone has room to relax and unwind.<br>Property Highlights<br>Quiet neighborhood setting<br>4 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms<br>Sleeps up to 14 guests in beds and 2 air mattresses available with bedding. <br>Beautiful community pool access<br>Parking for 3 vehicles<br>Two spacious living areas for gathering and relaxing<br>Fully stocked kitchen for family meals<br>Full-size washer and dryer<br>Fast WiFi for streaming and remote work<br>Local Dining Favorites<br>Some of the best restaurants along 30A are just minutes away:<br>Pescado Rooftop Bar – Upscale seafood with incredible Gulf views<br>Restaurant Paradis – Fine dining in Rosemary Beach<br>Edward's Fine Food & Wine – Local favorite with refined coastal cuisine<br>Cuvee 30A – Award-winning Gulf Coast cuisine<br>Amici 30A Italian Kitchen – Authentic Italian dining<br>Aja Elevated Asian – Creative Asian-inspired dishes<br>George's at Alys Beach – A 30A institution<br>The Citizen – Elevated coastal cuisine in Alys Beach<br>Shades Bar & Grill – Casual dining and sports bar within walking distance<br>If you venture into Panama City Beach, favorites include Saltwater Grill, Firefly, and Billy's Oyster Bar.<br>Fun Things to Do Along 30A<br>Bike the scenic Timpoochee Trail<br>Paddleboard or kayak in the Gulf or dune lakes<br>Visit the Rosemary Beach Farmers Market<br>Enjoy outdoor movies and concerts on St. Augustine Green<br>Explore the charming streets and shops of Rosemary Beach<br>Play tennis at the Rosemary Beach Racquet Club<br>Visit Frank Brown Park for pickleball, sports fields, and recreation<br>The Experience<br>Spend your days relaxing on the beach, biking along scenic coastal paths, or lounging at the beautiful community poolafter a morning in the Gulf. With its spacious layout, prime location near the beach, and easy access to shopping and dining, Seabreeze Sanctuary offers the perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and coastal charm.<br>Book your stay today and experience the beauty of Inlet Beach and Scenic Highway 30A.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
